- **Goods/heavy vehicles:** box trucks, tippers (white, yellow, blue, teal), multi-axle tippers (78, 113), container trucks (153, 170, 208, 607), tankers (9, 105, 554, 555, 615, 675, 715), cement mixers (95, 149, 217, 526, 581, 647, 702), an "Amul Milk" box truck (532), an Ashok Leyland goods truck (581), AMC garbage truck (583) and AMC tipper (584), auto-carrier (567), tractor-trolleys (552, 670, 682, 686), backhoe loaders (546, 673) and an orange backhoe on a low trailer (156).
