**People:** pedestrian numbers tracked the hour — heavy early evening (groups near the left market/bus stop, auto stand and viaduct stalls, ~2–20 per minute), thinning overnight to zero or one or two figures, rising again after dawn. Notable: many pedestrians crossed the main carriageway on foot at various minutes (see Section 7).

